Appendix B - Wrapper Parameters
Parameter	Purpose	Typical CPM Source
Action	Change, Reconcile, Verify, or Prereq.	Platform action mapping.
TargetServer	Target Domain Controller hostname/FQDN.	CyberArk Address.
NewPassword	CPM-generated password.	CyberArk NewPassword placeholder.
NtdsutilPath	Optional explicit ntdsutil.exe path.	Platform/account custom property if required.
TimeoutSeconds	Maximum wait time for NTDSUTIL.	Platform ExtraInfo or wrapper default.
UseLocalNullServer	Use reset password on server null for local DC execution.	Account/platform custom property for local mode.
LogFolder	Location for sanitized wrapper logs.	Wrapper default or platform override.

